## 1. HOD (Head of Department) - Super Admin

### What HOD Can Do
| Action | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **Manage Faculty** | Create, update, delete faculty accounts |
| **Manage Students** | Create, update, delete student accounts (bulk upload) |
| **Assign Faculty** | Assign faculty to classes and subjects |
| **View All Data** | See all attendance, analytics, reports |
| **Approve All** | Override any leave/correction request |
| **Announcements** | Broadcast messages to department |
| **Generate Reports** | Export PDF/Excel reports |

### HOD Login Flow
```
1. HOD enters email + password
2. System validates credentials
3. JWT token generated with role="hod"
4. Frontend loads HOD Dashboard
5. API calls include Authorization header
6. Backend verifies HOD role for all requests
```

### HOD API Endpoints
```
POST   /api/auth/hod/login          → Login
GET    /api/hod/dashboard           → Dashboard stats
GET    /api/hod/faculty             → List all faculty
POST   /api/hod/faculty             → Create faculty
PUT    /api/hod/faculty/{id}        → Update faculty
DELETE /api/hod/faculty/{id}        → Delete faculty
GET    /api/hod/students            → List all students
POST   /api/hod/students            → Create student
POST   /api/hod/students/bulk       → Bulk create students
PUT    /api/hod/students/{id}       → Update student
DELETE /api/hod/students/{id}       → Delete student
POST   /api/hod/assignments         → Assign faculty to class
GET    /api/hod/low-attendance      → At-risk students
GET    /api/hod/analytics           → Department analytics
```

---

## 2. Faculty - Class Admin

### What Faculty Can Do
| Action | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **View Assigned Classes** | Only see students in assigned classes |
| **Mark Attendance** | Create sessions, mark present/absent |
| **Approve Requests** | Approve/reject leave & corrections |
| **View Analytics** | Class-level attendance statistics |
| **Communicate** | Message students & HOD |

### Faculty Login Flow
```
1. Faculty enters name/email + unique ID
2. System validates unique_id in users table
3. JWT token generated with role="faculty"
4. Frontend loads Faculty Dashboard
5. API calls filtered to assigned classes only
6. Backend verifies faculty owns the class/session
```

### Faculty API Endpoints
```
POST   /api/auth/faculty/login      → Login with unique ID
GET    /api/faculty/dashboard       → Dashboard stats
GET    /api/faculty/assigned-classes → List assigned classes
GET    /api/faculty/classes/{id}/students → Students in class
POST   /api/faculty/sessions        → Create attendance session
PUT    /api/faculty/sessions/{id}/complete → Complete session
POST   /api/faculty/attendance/mark → Mark bulk attendance
GET    /api/faculty/leave-requests/pending → Pending leaves
PUT    /api/faculty/leave-requests/{id} → Approve/reject leave
GET    /api/faculty/corrections/pending → Pending corrections
PUT    /api/faculty/corrections/{id} → Approve/reject correction
GET    /api/faculty/analytics/class/{id} → Class analytics
```

### Faculty Access Restriction
```python
# Faculty can ONLY access their assigned classes
assignments = get_faculty_assignments(faculty_id)
allowed_class_ids = [a.class_id for a in assignments]

if requested_class_id not in allowed_class_ids:
    raise HTTP_403_FORBIDDEN
```

---

## 3. Student - User

### What Student Can Do
| Action | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **View Attendance** | Own attendance summary & history |
| **Submit Leave** | Request leave with documents |
| **Request Correction** | Ask to correct wrong attendance |
| **View Notifications** | Alerts, announcements |
| **View Timetable** | Class schedule |

### Student Login Flow
```
1. Student enters email/roll + password or unique ID
2. System validates credentials
3. JWT token generated with role="student"
4. Frontend loads Student Dashboard
5. API calls filtered to student's own data only
6. Backend verifies student_id matches token
```

### Student API Endpoints
```
POST   /api/auth/student/login      → Login
GET    /api/student/dashboard       → Dashboard stats
GET    /api/student/attendance/summary → Subject-wise summary
GET    /api/student/attendance/history → Detailed history
GET    /api/student/leave-requests  → Own leave requests
POST   /api/student/leave-requests  → Submit new leave
DELETE /api/student/leave-requests/{id} → Cancel leave
GET    /api/student/corrections     → Own correction requests
POST   /api/student/corrections     → Submit correction
GET    /api/student/notifications   → All notifications
POST   /api/student/notifications/mark-read → Mark as read
GET    /api/student/timetable       → Class timetable
GET    /api/student/announcements   → Announcements
```

### Student Access Restriction
```python
# Students can ONLY access their own data
if request.student_id != token.student_id:
    raise HTTP_403_FORBIDDEN
```

---

## Data Flow Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant HOD
    participant System
    participant Faculty
    participant Student
    participant Parent
    
    Note over HOD,System: Setup Phase
    HOD->>System: Create Faculty Account
    HOD->>System: Create Student Accounts
    HOD->>System: Assign Faculty to Classes
    
    Note over Faculty,Student: Daily Attendance
    Faculty->>System: Start Attendance Session
    Faculty->>System: Mark Student Present/Absent
    System->>Student: Real-time Notification
    System-->>Parent: SMS Alert (if < 75%)
    
    Note over Student,System: Request Flow
    Student->>System: Submit Leave Request
    System->>Faculty: Notification
    Faculty->>System: Approve/Reject
    System->>Student: Status Notification
    
    Note over HOD,System: Analytics
    System->>HOD: Daily Analytics Auto-Update
    HOD->>System: Generate Reports
    System->>HOD: PDF/Excel Download
```

---

## Permission Matrix

| Resource | HOD | Faculty | Student |
|----------|-----|---------|---------|
| **Faculty Accounts** | CRUD | - | - |
| **Student Accounts** | CRUD | Read (assigned) | - |
| **Attendance Sessions** | Read | CRUD (own) | - |
| **Attendance Records** | Read/Update | CRUD (own sessions) | Read (own) |
| **Leave Requests** | All | Approve (assigned) | Create/Read (own) |
| **Corrections** | All | Approve (own sessions) | Create/Read (own) |
| **Announcements** | CRUD | Read | Read |
| **Analytics** | Full | Class-only | Own-only |
| **Reports** | Generate | - | - |

