## Database Relationships

```
users (1) ─────────── (1) hod_profiles
users (1) ─────────── (1) faculty_profiles
users (1) ─────────── (1) student_profiles

hod_profiles (1) ─────── (N) faculty_profiles (created_by)
departments (1) ─────── (N) faculty_profiles
departments (1) ─────── (N) student_profiles
departments (1) ─────── (N) classes

faculty_profiles (1) ── (N) faculty_assignments
classes (1) ─────────── (N) faculty_assignments
subjects (1) ────────── (N) faculty_assignments

classes (1) ─────────── (N) student_profiles
classes (1) ─────────── (N) attendance_sessions

attendance_sessions (1) ── (N) attendance_records
student_profiles (1) ──── (N) attendance_records

student_profiles (1) ──── (N) leave_requests
student_profiles (1) ──── (N) attendance_corrections
```

---

## Authentication Tokens

| Role | Token Contains | Expires |
|------|----------------|---------|
| HOD | `{sub: email, role: "hod", user_id, department_id}` | 30 min |
| Faculty | `{sub: email, role: "faculty", user_id, faculty_id}` | 30 min |
| Student | `{sub: email, role: "student", user_id, student_id}` | 30 min |

All tokens can be refreshed using refresh_token (7 days validity).

---

## Notification Flow

```
1. Attendance Marked
   └─> If present: ✅ Notification to Student
   └─> If absent: ⚠️ Notification + SMS to Parent

2. Attendance < 75%
   └─> 🚨 Alert to Student
   └─> 🚨 Alert to Parent (SMS)
   └─> 📊 Added to HOD "At Risk" List

3. Leave Request Status Change
   └─> 📬 Notification to Student

4. Correction Approved
   └─> ✅ Notification to Student
   └─> 📝 Attendance Record Updated
```

